                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "678ba41d-11c7-349a-b5b5-419f0d299d69",
                        "entry_id": "42ed7f67-24e5-3b19-9eaf-5aa7d04e3e01",
                        "glosses": [
                            "crust (a large end-piece of a loaf of bread)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c90f5db-5cc9-4a91-b1ea-5de1658daf20",
                                "sense_id": "678ba41d-11c7-349a-b5b5-419f0d299d69",
                                "text": "Дя́дя Пётр приноси́л огро́мную краю́ху бе́лого хле́ба и варе́нье «се́мечки» в большо́й гли́няной ба́нке, ре́зал хлеб ломтя́ми, ще́дро сма́зывал их варе́ньем и раздава́л всем э́ти вку́сные мали́новые ло́мти, держа́ их на ладо́ни, ни́зко кла́няясь.",
                                "translation": "Uncle Peter would bring an enormous crust of white bread and a large earthenware jar of home-made jam. He would slice the bread, smear it liberally with jam, and hold out the tasty slices in the palms of his hands as he offered them to the guests with a low bow.",
                                "english": "Uncle Peter would bring an enormous crust of white bread and a large earthenware jar of home-made jam. He would slice the bread, smear it liberally with jam, and hold out the tasty slices in the palms of his hands as he offered them to the guests with a low bow."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
